  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); white-space: pre-wrap;\">(19 fotos) La Casa de la Cultura d&#39;Onda ha acollit recentment la jornada que convocava responsables de temes de m&oacute;n rural, sostenibilitat i sobirania aliment&agrave;ria en&nbsp;ajuntaments i cercles de Podem per a presentar eixa nova secretaria. </span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/10/img_9239.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); white-space: pre-wrap;\">Durant l&#39;encontre se&#39;ls ha oferit ajuda i s&#39;ha sol&middot;licitat el seu suport&nbsp;per a establir xarxes de col&middot;laboraci&oacute;. Tamb&eacute; s&#39;ha fet l&#39;assemblea del cercle de M&oacute;n Rural, Ecologia i Sobirania Aliment&agrave;ria (MES).</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9239.jpg\" alt=\"img_9239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9240.jpg\" alt=\"img_9240\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9243.jpg\" alt=\"img_9243\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9244.jpg\" alt=\"img_9244\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9247.jpg\" alt=\"img_9247\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9248.jpg\" alt=\"img_9248\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9249.jpg\" alt=\"img_9249\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9251.jpg\" alt=\"img_9251\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9252.jpg\" alt=\"img_9252\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9256.jpg\" alt=\"img_9256\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9258.jpg\" alt=\"img_9258\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9259.jpg\" alt=\"img_9259\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9263.jpg\" alt=\"img_9263\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9264.jpg\" alt=\"img_9264\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9269.jpg\" alt=\"img_9269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9270.jpg\" alt=\"img_9270\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9277.jpg\" alt=\"img_9277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/asamblepodemosdissabte/img_9282.jpg\" alt=\"img_9282\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"ht